BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chace-Cory House Tours
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260607
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260608
DTSTAMP:20260830T145809Z
UID:da82b7ce9501a09fb9564885aab6@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Chace-Cory House Tours Open Sundays\, June 7 - September 6\, 2
 026 from 2:00 to 4:30 PM Location: 3908 Main Road\, Tiverton\, RI 02878 Th
 is season\, in honor of our country’s semiquincentennial\, we have a spe
 cial exhibit in our c. 1730 house museum: a silk flag flown by George Wash
 ington’s RI Regiment\, a rare Huntington engraving of the Declaration of
  Independence\, a map of the 1778 Battle of RI showing redoubts and troop 
 movements\, a surveyor’s chart of Narragansett Bay and environs of July 
 1776\, Civil War uniforms\, and more! Guided tours of the house are held S
 undays during the hours of 2-4:30 pm from June 7th to September 6th. There
  is a small preservation donation for THS non-members. Email: TivertonHist
 oricalSocy@tivertonhistorical.org with any questions\, find more contact i
 nformation here.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/chace-c
 ory-house-tours/111034/
LOCATION:3908 Main Road\, Tiverton\, RI 02878 This season\, in honor of ou
 r country’s semiquincentennial\, we have a special exhibit in our c. 173
 0 house museum: a silk flag flown by George Washington’s RI Regiment\, a
  rare Huntington engraving of the Declaration of Independence\, a map of t
 he 1778 Battle of RI showing redoubts and troop movements\, a surveyor’s
  chart of Narragansett Bay and environs of July 1776\, Civil War uniforms
 \, and more! Guided tours of the house are held Sundays during the hours o
 f 2-4:30 pm from June 7th to September 6th. There is a small preservation 
 donation for THS non-members. Email: TivertonHistoricalSocy@tivertonhistor
 ical.org with any questions\, find more contact information here. Show Mor
 e View Website | Email 1 / 1 Additional Information\, 3908 Main Road\, Tiv
 erton\, RI 02878 Time: 2:00 PM to 4:30 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/chace-cory-house-tours/111034/
END:VEVENT
