BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Assembly of Food Trucks 2026
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260830
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260831
DTSTAMP:20260830T145809Z
UID:52b850bdffa170a5a98293a9b0fb@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The return to the the Assembly Theatre in 2026 will be a memor
 able and fun series of Sunday nights out! Details and food truck lineup at
  https://www.foodtrucksin.com/assemblyburrillville This vibrant evening wh
 ere food trucks line the walkway\, takes place on the grounds against the 
 backdrop of the Nipmuc River. Nearby\, the Harrisville Pond cascades over 
 a grand stone dam\, creating a rhythmic backdrop as water tumbles down in 
 a whitewater dance. Enjoy good eats\, beats\, and beers and the sight of t
 he falls\, in this picturesque setting. Make yourself at home on the lawn.
  Bring chairs\, and blankets and enjoy the evening with family and friends
 . Enjoy a dozen or more food trucks at each event from a rotation of over 
 75 food trucks🚚🌮🍔. In addition to great food\, there will be 🎵
 🎵🎵 live bands and Good Vibes Beverages will be serving up will be se
 rving up local beer and wine\, mocktails and more. 🍺🍻🍷 Attendance
  is free\, just pay for what you eat and drink. Tickets are not necessary.
  All food trucks accept cash\, credit\, and debit cards 💳💰. 🚫Smok
 ing\, vaping and e-cigarettes are prohibited.. 🚫Guests are not permitte
 d to bring their own coolers with alcohol. 🐾 Pets are not encouraged. 
 🌍 Let's care for our environment together - please take recyclable item
 s home with you.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/assembl
 y-of-food-trucks-2026/108618/
LOCATION:26 East Ave\, Burrillville\, RI 02830 Time: 4:30 PM to 8:00 PM 26
  East Ave\, Burrillville\, RI 02830 OFFICIAL RHODE ISLAND TRAVEL GUIDE Get
