BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cars & Coffee - Mount Hope Farm
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260830
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260831
DTSTAMP:20260830T145809Z
UID:2b5d4774f2302b7894402874fa2a@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Cars &amp\; Coffee When: Select Sundays from 8:00 AM to 10:00 
 AM at Mount Hope Farm\, 250 Metacom Avenue\, Bristol June 7 August 30 Cars
  &amp\; Coffee\, hosted by the Audrain Automobile Museum\, has grown expon
 entially since the start - now eight years ago\, only 52 cars appeared at 
 the first event! The Cars &amp\; Coffee family has expanded\, now consiste
 ntly seeing 350-400 cars on the field and more than 1\,000 at the Motor We
 ek event. We feel that Cars &amp\; Coffee is now the backbone Audrain Auto
 mobile Museum and the local car community as well. Cheers to another seaso
 n! Below are a couple reminders for the 2026 Season: For Audrain Members\,
  registration will open the Monday before each of the Cars &amp\; Coffee e
 vents and public registration will open on the Wednesday before each of th
 e Cars &amp\; Coffee events. In order to register for one of the Cars &amp
 \; Coffee events\, you must be subscribed to our email list. You cannot re
 gister for any of the Cars &amp\; Coffee events through the Audrain websit
 e or over the phone. Only Vehicles are required to register for the event.
  Guests of drivers\, and spectators do not need to register. *All events a
 re subject to change. All events are rain or shine unless noted.\n\nSource
 : https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/cars-%26-coffee-mount-hope-farm/1
 09993/
LOCATION:Mount Hope Farm\, 250 Metacom Avenue\, Bristol\, RI 02809 Time: 8
 :00 AM to 10:00 AM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/cars-%26-coffee-mount-hope-farm
 /109993/
END:VEVENT
